{"name":"Noted!","slug":"noted","version":"2.0.3","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/skvandeusen\/\">Kyle Van Deusen<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/skvandeusen\/","contributors":{"skvandeusen":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/skvandeusen\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/9460c5783a519152043fed2b5c99d72ba7e53df8a5991f78a489677e4d5795cc?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"Kyle Van Deusen"},"tdrayson":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/tdrayson\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/fe2e21702df71f25857a64f75d4afd626ee043b344bbbe068762862190b3d205?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"tdrayson"}},"requires":"5.3","tested":"6.9.11","requires_php":"8.1","requires_plugins":[],"rating":100,"ratings":{"5":15,"4":0,"3":0,"2":0,"1":0},"num_ratings":15,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/noted\/","support_threads":1,"support_threads_resolved":1,"active_installs":1000,"last_updated":"2026-10-14 8:49pm GMT","added":"2024-11-22","homepage":"","sections":{"description":"<p>Noted! is a lightweight note-taking plugin for WordPress. Capture project notes, attach reminders to specific posts and pages, and leave notes on individual blocks in the editor \u2014 all without leaving the admin.<\/p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/w8L9smQBA6k?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"><\/iframe><\/span><\/p>\n<p><em>Your Project Memory Bank<\/em><br \/>\nStore project-specific notes, instructions, and reminders in one place \u2014 no more digging through old emails or docs.<\/p>\n<p><em>Always One-Click Away<\/em><br \/>\nOpen Noted! from the admin bar on any screen, front-end or back-end.<\/p>\n<p><em>Lightweight and Clutter-Free<\/em><br \/>\nNo bloat. Noted! is there when you need it and out of the way when you don&#8217;t.<\/p>\n<h4>Features<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Quick general notes from the admin bar.<\/li>\n<li>Page-level notes attached to any post or page.<\/li>\n<li>Block-level notes that travel with the block when copied or pasted.<\/li>\n<li>Pin important notes and see them on your dashboard.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","installation":"<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>noted<\/code> directory to your <code>\/wp-content\/plugins\/<\/code> directory.<\/li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.<\/li>\n<li>Access your notes via the Noted! button in the admin bar.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n","faq":"\n<h4>\nHow do I add a note?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Click the Noted! button in the admin bar, fill in the title and description, and click &#8220;Add Note&#8221;.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nCan I edit or delete a note?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Use the edit and delete action links on any note.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nHow do I attach a note to a specific page?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Open the post or page in the editor. In the block editor, use the Noted! panel in the sidebar. In the classic editor, use the Noted! meta box.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nHow do I leave a note on a single block?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Select a block in the block editor and use the Noted! option in the block toolbar or sidebar. The note travels with the block when copied or pasted.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nWho can see notes?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>By default, only administrators. You can change this under Tools <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span> Noted! to allow editors, authors, or contributors to view or manage notes.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nHow do I report a bug or request a feature?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Please open an issue on GitHub &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/tdrayson\/noted\/issues\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https:\/\/github.com\/tdrayson\/noted\/issues<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n\n","changelog":"<h4>2.0.3<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Inline <code>code<\/code> now works in notes. Text between backticks is shown exactly as typed.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: Underscores inside words (field_name, snake_case, URLs) are no longer turned into italics.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: A # in the middle of a line (&#8220;issue #42&#8221;, &#8220;C#&#8221;) no longer turns the rest of the line into a heading.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: A numbered list straight after a bulleted list (or the other way round) is now its own list.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: Links at the end of a sentence no longer include the full stop, and bare links survive editing older notes.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: &#8220;Requires PHP&#8221; now says 8.1, the version Noted! actually needs, so WordPress won&#8217;t activate it on older PHP and break the site.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.2<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Note fields no longer appear inside other plugins&#8217; preview iframes in the editor, such as the MetaSlider block.<\/li>\n<li>Improved: Updated the settings framework \u2014 dropdowns on the settings page position correctly, and other plugins&#8217; admin notices no longer clutter the Noted! settings screen.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0.1<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Block notes on server-rendered (dynamic) blocks no longer fail attribute validation.<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: Noted panel uses full width on narrow viewports (still capped at 400px).<\/li>\n<li>Fixed: Settings page wireframe assets load correctly on Windows when the package path contains backslashes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>2.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New: Page-level notes \u2014 attach notes to any post or page from the block editor sidebar or the classic editor.<\/li>\n<li>New: Block-level notes \u2014 leave a note on any individual block in the editor. Notes travel with the block when copied or pasted.<\/li>\n<li>New: Pin your most important notes to keep them at the top of the list.<\/li>\n<li>New: Pinned Notes dashboard widget so the things you need to remember are waiting for you when you log in.<\/li>\n<li>New: Settings page under Tools <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span> Noted! to turn features on or off, control who sees what, and back up your settings.<\/li>\n<li>New: Role-based access \u2014 by default only administrators can see and manage notes, but you can now lower the bar to let editors, authors, or contributors view or manage them.<\/li>\n<li>New: Markdown reference tab so you can see exactly which formatting is supported.<\/li>\n<li>New: Import and export your settings as a JSON file.<\/li>\n<li>New: Optional &#8220;delete all data on uninstall&#8221; toggle \u2014 off by default so upgrades stay safe.<\/li>\n<li>New: Translation-ready \u2014 the plugin can now be translated into other languages.<\/li>\n<li>New: Now respects your WordPress admin color scheme.<\/li>\n<li>Improved: Compatibility support for plugins that dequeue all scripts on their admin pages.<\/li>\n<li>Improved: Cleaner, faster note panel with a tidier date format.<\/li>\n<li>Improved: Empty notes (no title and no body) are hidden from the list automatically.<\/li>\n<li>Improved: Better safeguards so notes can only be attached to posts you have permission to edit.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release of the Noted! plugin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","screenshots":"<ol><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/noted\/assets\/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=3195171\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/noted\/assets\/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=3195171\" alt=\"Adding a new note\"><\/a><p>Adding a new note<\/p><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/noted\/assets\/screenshot-2.jpg?rev=3195171\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/noted\/assets\/screenshot-2.jpg?rev=3195171\" alt=\"Viewing existing notes\"><\/a><p>Viewing existing notes<\/p><\/li><\/ol>","reviews":"<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great Plugin - Very Helpful<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/nmv\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/6f080861c5701e5387df39264658021df9344463c8c5916820af38f0231d4e62?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/6f080861c5701e5387df39264658021df9344463c8c5916820af38f0231d4e62?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/nmv\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">nmv<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 26, 2026<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I use it primarily to leave client notes.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Feature suggestion: In addition to the ability to pin notes, add a method to sort (possibly using drag-and-drop).<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for a great plugin!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Highly Recommended!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/sromal\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/adc1a38fab1f31b9cf8e1fe49742dc89b44bbb69cf14e5d3a225536c0cf1fd82?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/adc1a38fab1f31b9cf8e1fe49742dc89b44bbb69cf14e5d3a225536c0cf1fd82?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/sromal\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">vsual <small>(sromal)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 19, 2026<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I was looking for something like this, no more looking :) <\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Super helpful, super simple<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/r5websites\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/c2eb783bce83d614f64f616dc6de0c4dc9f53762e923f7f4069cb920ebcc8c30?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/c2eb783bce83d614f64f616dc6de0c4dc9f53762e923f7f4069cb920ebcc8c30?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/r5websites\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">r5websites<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 23, 2026<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I've added this to my agency's blueprint site. It's a great tool for leaving behind notes to my clients, my team, or even MYSELF about how certain aspects of the site are organized or setup. We also add it to sites we inherit so we can leave each other notes about where certain functions might be found, etc. Saves us a lot of time duplicating research.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">I have always been missing such a plugin<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/stef1964\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/d71355be291e888d47f4eee36b318af4e60329ae69e6e3585de453205728da54?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/d71355be291e888d47f4eee36b318af4e60329ae69e6e3585de453205728da54?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/stef1964\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">stef1964<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">March 6, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Superhandy and simple, I love it :-)<br>I would really like it if there was a way to always display the notes panel on the dashboard.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great utility<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/w1cky\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/b59e5d6c3ef4e3564f1d451e5bbb135956361fa3cf84f3d61aed8388b61ddcb2?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/b59e5d6c3ef4e3564f1d451e5bbb135956361fa3cf84f3d61aed8388b61ddcb2?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/w1cky\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\"> <small>(w1cky)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">January 10, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simple and really nice to have.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">This is a timesaver<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/schoene-heide\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/dffca944faff3791dba0ea91399c37b089879099a84d434a2e2a4567847bcc61?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/dffca944faff3791dba0ea91399c37b089879099a84d434a2e2a4567847bcc61?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/schoene-heide\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">schoene-heide<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">December 17, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now I can note relevant info in the backend of the website and do not have to look it up on my computer. Great timesaver, thanks Kyle!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Very useful to store vital site notes!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/presswizards\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/f66299d5948444b1207eff99d0e7bd9e192d6edbfdb4746cdd3663fea2f6372b?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/f66299d5948444b1207eff99d0e7bd9e192d6edbfdb4746cdd3663fea2f6372b?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/presswizards\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Rob - 5StarPlugins \/ PressWizards <small>(presswizards)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">December 16, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simple to use, easy to make notes as needed! Love the functionality and a very light weight code base that won\u2019t slow down your site. <\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Thank You!!!!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/knelsonkris\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/76854bf1e006244b568f41979a76e6e22bac9e09fe7838728166d007111dac65?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/76854bf1e006244b568f41979a76e6e22bac9e09fe7838728166d007111dac65?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/knelsonkris\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">knelsonkris<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">November 29, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exactly what I needed to keep track of things on each site!  Best solution I have ever seen.  Thank you so much.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great tutorials and useful plugins!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/meymigrou\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/138d957eba65e798376c8fdd6e71d093bb9b6802269b163018a0265a481eba24?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/138d957eba65e798376c8fdd6e71d093bb9b6802269b163018a0265a481eba24?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/meymigrou\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Panos Sakalakis <small>(meymigrou)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">November 28, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Apart from the neat tutorials he's been creating on YouTube, Kyle has outdone himself with this plugin! Minimal, easy to use, and ideal for multiple admins to quickly add their notes.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you, and keep up the great work!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">I&#039;ve needed this!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/torsails\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/9208783b051f0acf96b7c99766c99c878c5f8a52256c29be4752ba24d95d8baa?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/9208783b051f0acf96b7c99766c99c878c5f8a52256c29be4752ba24d95d8baa?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/torsails\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">torsails<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">November 27, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This plugin is what I needed\u2014lightweight, simple, and right where you need it for taking notes!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n"},"download_link":"https:\/\/downloads.wordpress.org\/plugin\/noted.2.0.3.zip","upgrade_notice":{"2.0.3":"<p>Markdown fixes (inline code, underscores in words, # mid-line) and the correct PHP requirement (8.1).<\/p>","2.0.2":"<p>Bugfix release: note fields no longer leak into other plugins&#039; editor preview iframes, plus settings framework updates.<\/p>","2.0.1":"<p>Bugfix release: block notes on dynamic blocks, panel width on small screens, and Windows settings asset paths.<\/p>","2.0":"<p>Major update adding page-level notes, block-level notes, pinning, dashboard widget, settings page, and role-based access.<\/p>","1.0":"<p>Initial release.<\/p>"},"tags":{"admin":"admin","dashboard":"dashboard","markdown":"markdown","notes":"notes","productivity":"productivity"},"business_model":false,"repository_url":"","commercial_support_url":"","guideline_labels":[],"donate_link":"","banners":{"low":"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/noted\/assets\/banner-772x250.png?rev=3195171","high":"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/noted\/assets\/banner-1544x500.png?rev=3195173"},"preview_link":""}